    <section id="faq" style="padding: 100px 5%;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Common Questions</h2>
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">What digital marketing services do you offer?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We offer a complete range of services to help businesses build a strong online presence and grow their brand. Our services include Digital Marketing, Influencer Marketing, Web Development, Branding, Social Media Management, Professional Photography, and Content Creation. Whether you’re looking to increase brand awareness, generate leads, or establish a powerful digital identity, we create customized strategies tailored to your business goals.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">How long does it take to see results?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">The timeline depends on your goals, industry, and the services you choose. Some campaigns, such as paid advertising, can start generating results within a few days, while brand-building and organic growth typically take more time. We focus on creating sustainable strategies that deliver consistent, measurable growth rather than short-term spikes.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Which businesses do you work with?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We work with businesses of all sizes. From startups and local businesses to established brands. Whether you’re in healthcare, fitness, real estate, education, e-commerce, hospitality, or professional services, we create strategies tailored to your industry.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Do I need a large budget to start digital marketing?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Not at all. We create customized marketing plans based on your goals and budget. Whether you’re investing a modest amount or running large-scale campaigns, we’ll recommend the most effective strategy.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">How do you measure the success of a campaign?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We track key performance indicators (KPIs) such as website traffic, leads, conversions, return on ad spend (ROAS), engagement, reach, and revenue. You’ll receive regular performance reports with transparent insights.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Will I receive regular updates on my campaigns?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Yes. We provide detailed reports and ongoing communication so you always know how your campaigns are performing, what improvements are being made, and what results are being achieved.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Can you manage our social media accounts?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Absolutely. We handle content planning, graphic design, video editing, posting, community management, and performance analysis to help your brand stay active and engaging across all major social media platforms.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">What makes your agency different?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We don’t believe in one-size-fits-all marketing. Every strategy is customized to your business goals, audience, and industry. Our focus is on delivering measurable growth, transparent communication, and long-term partnerships.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Do I need a website before starting digital marketing?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Having a website is highly recommended because it builds credibility and improves conversions. If you don’t already have one, we can design and develop a professional, high-performing website for your business.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Do you require long-term contracts?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We offer flexible engagement options. Depending on the service, you can choose monthly plans or long-term partnerships that best suit your business needs.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Do you work with clients outside my city or country?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Yes. We work with clients across India and internationally through online meetings, regular reporting, and seamless communication.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Can you run Meta (Facebook & Instagram) and Google Ads?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">Yes. Our team creates, manages, and optimizes advertising campaigns across Meta and Google to maximize leads, sales, and return on investment.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">What information do you need before starting?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">We’ll discuss your business, target audience, competitors, goals, existing marketing efforts, and budget. This helps us create a strategy tailored specifically to your brand.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-green); cursor: pointer;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem;">Do you guarantee results?</summary>
            <p style="padding-top: 10px;">No ethical agency can guarantee specific rankings or sales. What we do guarantee is a data-driven approach, continuous optimization, transparency, and a commitment to achieving the best possible results for your business.</p>
        </details>
    </div>
</section>

